So I'm this barbarian, and I visit a bookstore, accompanied by my faithful
(and wellfed) kitten Bark, and we rob the place blind.  I've got about 
8 spellbooks and a lot of scrolls, and I have enough identify scrolls
to discover the fire and destroy-armor scrolls in the batch.
Well, we walk down the stairs, hang out for a while, and I notice this
treasure chest in the corner.  It's locked, but I'm a strong dextrous guy,
so I kick it open (I mean really, what self-respecting barbarian OPENS doors).
There's another white spellbook in it, which I take, and a yellowish brown
gem? [ynaq]  Well, of course I type y, and I get this message
	hack[10]: 19085 Memory fault
Not even the decency of a core dump, much less a bones file so SOMEBODY
